03:47:36.440 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
03:47:36.440   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
03:47:36.440   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
